  "hints": [
    "Factor the numerator (difference of squares) and the denominator (perfect square)."
  ],
  "solution": [
    "$x^2 - 9 = (x-3)(x+3)$ and $x^2 + 6x + 9 = (x+3)^2$.",
    "Cancel one factor of $x + 3$: $\\frac{x-3}{x+3}$."
  ],
